# Normalize line endings across Windows (WSL) and Linux collaborators.
# Text files are stored with LF in the repo and checked out with LF,
# so no more phantom CRLF diffs between machines.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep shell scripts LF explicitly (they must be LF to run).
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch their bytes or convert line endings.
FlexFringe/flexfringe binary
*.png binary
*.svg binary
*.dot binary
*.gz binary
